text":"初，偽太后馮氏兄昌黎王馮莎二女，大馮美而有疾，為尼，小馮為宏皇后，生偽太子詢。後大馮疾差，宏納為昭儀。宏初徙都，詢意不樂，思歸桑乾。宏制衣冠與之，詢竊毀裂，解髮為編服左衽。大馮有寵，日夜讒詢。宏出鄴城馬射，詢因是欲叛北歸，密選宮中御馬三千疋置河陰渚。皇后聞之，召執詢，馳使告宏，宏徙詢無鼻城，在河橋北二里，尋殺之，以庶人禮葬。立大馮為皇后，便立偽太子恪，是歲，偽太和二十年也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":78,"last_line":78,"raw_start":9153,"raw_end":9348,"raw_character_offsets":[9153,9154,9155,9156,9157,9158,9159,9160,9161,9162,9163,9164,9165,9166,9167,9168,9169,9170,9171,9172,9173,9174,9175,9176,9177,9178,9179,9180,9181,9182,9183,9184,9185,9186,9187,9188,9189,9190,9191,9192,9193,9194,9195,9196,9197,9198,9199,9200,9201,9202,9203,9204,9205,9206,9207,9208,9209,9210,9211,9212,9213,9214,9215,9216,9217,9218,9219,9220,9221,9222,9223,9224,9225,9226,9227,9228,9229,9230,9231,9232,9233,9234,9235,9236,9237,9238,9239,9240,9241,9242,9243,9244,9245,9246,9247,9248,9249,9250,9251,9252,9253,9254,9255,9256,9257,9258,9259,9260,9261,9262,9263,9264,9265,9266,9267,9268,9269,9270,9271,9272,9273,9274,9275,9276,9277,9278,9279,9280,9281,9282,9283,9284,9285,9286,9287,9288,9289,9290,9291,9292,9293,9294,9295,9296,9297,9298,9299,9300,9301,9302,9303,9304,9305,9306,9307,9308,9309,9310,9311,9312,9313,9314,9315,9316,9317,9318,9319,9320,9321,9322,9323,9324,9325,9326,9327,9328,9329,9330,9331,9332,9333,9339,9340,9341,9342,9343,9346,9347],"revision_id":1999801},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"馮氏","kind":"person","person_id":"ad8_il0_mf4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"馮莎","kind":"person","person_id":"d91_oe3_mrc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"大馮","kind":"person","person_id":"m8o_vkl_aua","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"小馮","kind":"person","person_id":"qfs_0c0_p7d","status":"contextual_p